# synstudio effect
name    deband
label   Deband
group   Texture
about   Breaks up the banding a heavily graded sky gets, without softening it
param   thr    0.02  0.00003  0.5  Threshold
param   range  16    1        64   Range
filter  [$in]deband=1thr=$thr:2thr=$thr:3thr=$thr:4thr=$thr:range=$range[$out]
